WEBVTT

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:10.590
Wiping off my tears.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:13.300
I'm starting to run now

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:18.560
Tomorrow I'll be born anew.

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:24.370
How could "you always be my friend"?

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:29.280
That person's word makes me more courageous.

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:33.480
There are times when it's possible I will be depressed

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:38.580
and there are times when things are delightful.

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:45.170
I'll always be

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:51.020
next to you.

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:55.910
Smiling 100%

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:59.450
Striking 100%

00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:03.640
I've come so far.

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:06.560
Being 100% pure

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:10.190
The things I want to tell you

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:14.670
change to treasure completely.

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:17.190
in the 100% case

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:20.950
Even if it's a long distance,

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:27.280
I'll still say I would meet you with the same feelings.

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:41.050
Hell’s Maestro was the client, Gotouda Manabu.

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:44.510
Gotouda-kun, that means that you...

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:45.760
Yes.

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:48.140
Sensei, I did it.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:50.310
It was me.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:55.610
I personally murdered the three who set up
that horrible trap for Houshou

00:01:56.380 --> 00:02:02.870
But, what awaited us after we solved the
crime was an unforeseeable tragedy.

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:04.740
Ryuu!

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:18.010
Gotouda-kun, wake up!

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:21.180
What happened, all of a sudden?

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:25.140
Now that you’ve mentioned it, he
was babbling some odd phrases.

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:28.430
“He who revealed the secret of the gods,

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:30.520
shall fall into Tartarus!”

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:33.770
What do you suppose Tartarus is?

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:39.280
According to Greek mythology,
it is the hell where the child of Zeus was sent.

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:40.950
Hell?

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:50.870
It’s said to be a land where all sinners suffer
for all eternity, ruled by a God named Hades.

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:52.870
Hades.

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:54.960
Also known as Pluto.

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:57.130
What do you mean?

00:02:57.480 --> 00:03:01.670
We wanted to avoid bringing this up for your safety,

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:06.760
but considering what's happened we have
no choice but to tell you about it now.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:13.100
“Pluto” is a criminal organization that
could be called Dan-sensei’s nemesis.

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:16.230
Dan-sensei’s nemesis?

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:20.860
And now that it’s obvious they’re involved,

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:23.570
considering the way they do things,

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:31.790
it’s quite possible that one of them is
still here, disguised as an observer.

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:34.830
A Pluto member is still here?

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:48.300
All right, as soon as I get over this.

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:52.180
Kinta.

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:54.980
You’re awake, Ryuu?

00:03:56.240 --> 00:03:57.990
I...

00:03:58.030 --> 00:04:00.080
Don't speak too much, it'll re-open you wounds.

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:04.320
It’s kind of my fault that this happened to you anyway.

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:08.410
If I hadn’t let Gotouda grab that knife there...

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:13.410
No. It’s my fault.

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:14.680
My...

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:17.500
Ryuu.

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:25.380
I'd like to have the four of you put into police custody, in
order to determine which of you Pluto member.

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:28.010
It may take a few days, though.

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:29.470
No way!

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:31.260
I can't do that!!

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:35.430
I have to go to a concert in Vienna in two days.

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:40.520
My Pluto mark is covered with special
makeup so it cannot be found.

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:44.530
But, I need to explain to Sir Anubis
that I hurt Ryuu-sama by accident.

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:48.030
I can’t have it take days.

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:51.620
I know, why don’t we do it here?

00:04:52.100 --> 00:05:00.380
If everybody takes off their clothes and our bodies
are checked thoroughly, you'll know for sure right?

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:03.750
It seems that we don’t need to do that.

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:09.300
I already know who it is.

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:11.510
Tachiki Arisa-san!

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:20.020
You had a knife that you were going to use to
get revenge for Houshou Mitsuru, didn’t you?

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:25.990
I did... but... I'm not a member of that group!

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:28.620
No, that means the opposite.

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:35.450
Pluto devises the murder plots, but
makes their clients execute them.

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:38.290
They never actually carry them out themselves.

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:44.170
Thus, you who was holding the murder
weapon, cannot be a member of Pluto.

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:47.670
Yuge-sensei!

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:53.100
Pluto disguise themselves perfectly, so well that
it's even possible to deceive their own family.

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:58.600
But they cannot imitate a genius violinist’s talent.

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:05.400
Thus if I was a member of Pluto, I would
never attempt to assume your identity.

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:08.860
Now then Fukuoka-san.

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:11.700
Hey wait!

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:13.170
I'm the real thing!

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:19.080
If you are not a member of Pluto, then prove it to me!

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:31.260
Oh no!

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:32.890
I landed without thinking!

00:06:33.070 --> 00:06:34.550
I thought so.

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:36.430
You’re the member of Pluto.

00:06:36.860 --> 00:06:37.980
Shiba-san is?

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:39.100
No way.

00:06:39.660 --> 00:06:41.310
Pluto certainly dropped its standards,

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:44.520
to send somebody as inexperienced as you.

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:45.700
Inexperienced?

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:47.230
How is that so?

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:50.690
Just now, you said everyone should take off
their clothes to have their bodies examined.

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:57.280
Pluto members have a tattoo that can never be
removed located somewhere on their bodies.

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:02.790
But, the only people who know that are the police, DDS

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:06.380
and Pluto themselves.

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:09.800
Am I wrong, Pluto?!

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:21.310
You can’t get away now, Pluto!

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:24.310
If I’m caught here I may as well...

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:29.860
Amazing! That’s a professional.

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:33.150
We could never do that.

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:36.160
Hey, Kyuu.

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:38.030
Huh?

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:44.580
Just a bit more.

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:50.550
Dammit!

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:54.010
Ryuu!

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:11.150
What a mess.

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:17.070
In the end, I screwed up.

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:22.700
Kinta...

00:08:24.340 --> 00:08:25.050
Ryuu.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:28.210
Please stay safe.

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:30.460
Kinta!

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:31.880
Ryuu!

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:34.420
Kinta!

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:36.260
Ryuu!

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:40.100
Kyuu!

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:45.520
Kinta!

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:48.900
Kyuu!

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:53.070
A detective can never give up.

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:03.080
I’m safe!

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:04.450
Thank goodness.

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:07.330
Ryuu!

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:08.330
Ryuu!

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:12.550
Alright, he’s safe!

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:14.760
Kyuu, you...

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:19.590
Ryuu put himself in danger to save me.

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:22.890
I have to do something for him!

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:27.810
Even if it is Hongou-sensei’s orders, I can’t just stay there!

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:36.530
I'm not going to let him die here.

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:39.030
Ryuu’s our comrade.

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:41.620
I won’t let him die!

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:42.950
I won't!

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:45.450
I'm going to save him!

00:09:57.860 --> 00:09:59.970
He’s still unconscious.

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:02.550
He was under powerful hypnosis.

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:07.600
When he wakes up, he'll probably have
forgotten that he had stabbed someone.

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:09.810
It’s all my fault.

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:18.320
I decided that I was going to give you
the Testa di Drago here, Gotouda-kun.

00:10:21.090 --> 00:10:24.450
the second genius that you spoke of was...

00:10:24.760 --> 00:10:26.790
Yes, it’s him.

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:30.460
It was-a totally different type
of talent to that of Houshou’s.

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:36.960
But I trained him very harshly because I valued his talent.

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:41.340
So when Houshou ended up like that,

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:48.140
I decided that you were the only one
who would inherit the Testa di Drago!

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:55.480
If I had told you sooner, you never would have done this.

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:59.860
It’s all my fault!

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:09.580
I can’t handle that.

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:15.840
Even if the crime was solved, what
we lost will never be returned.

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:21.090
Ruined friendships, shattered love,

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:23.720
the lives of the dead...

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:30.220
Arisa-san, what’s wrong?

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:31.680
Minami-san.

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:34.350
Is that your violin?

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:39.530
Yes, my late mother bought it for me a long
time ago and paid a very high price for it.

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:48.160
“Your sister is the great violinist Houshou Mitsuru,
so you must be able to play the violin well too.”

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:52.200
My sister was a source of pride and dreams to me.

00:11:53.230 --> 00:12:01.420
So when I heard about what happened to her, I came 
here as a maid to learn the truth about her suicide.

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:07.550
I don’t want to hear any sad melodies anymore.

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:21.570
A violin?

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:22.900
Who’s playing that?

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:24.320
That’s...

00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:54.490
It's unrefined, but it resounds in my heart.

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:57.490
What a warm, cheerful melody.

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:04.740
Yes. She is renewed hope, sent to me by God.

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:13.660
I must continue by strengthening her talent.

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:29.720
Ryuu.

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:34.310
Come this way, Ryuu.

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:38.600
You cannot run away from your fate.

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:46.320
The proud soul of a demon resides within
you, just as it resides within me.

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:49.320
Now, come with me.

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:52.070
No, I won’t!

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:54.120
Come.

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:56.000
No, no, no!

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:57.370
NO!

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:02.080
Oh, you’re awake!

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:04.090
You’re safe now!

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:06.880
Thanks to those two.

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:11.970
They carried you in here, frantic and covered in mud.

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:17.980
They said they'd carried you here all the way from
a villa on the other side of the mountain!

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:20.440
To save me?

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:22.810
For me?

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:25.150
Are they your classmates?

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:28.990
Comrades with the same ambitions as I.

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:32.320
No, friends!

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:50.840
You're afraid that some of your companions
may come to kill you to keep you quiet.

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:56.140
Don’t worry, this car’s protected with bulletproof glass.

00:14:56.730 --> 00:14:57.440
No.

00:14:57.910 --> 00:14:59.720
I am a member of Pluto.

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:02.060
I am not afraid of death.

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:04.690
But if he comes,

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:06.520
I'll...

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:25.500
Hey, what’s wrong?

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:26.630
Tartarus. ..

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:28.540
Tartarus!

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:37.140
Goodbye, Miss Caulie.

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:41.100
You'll never be sane again.

00:15:55.130 --> 00:15:56.700
Thanks, everyone.

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:59.240
Ahh, it was nothing.

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:02.330
Right Kyuu?

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:06.920
But Hongou-sensei was REALLY mad
at me for not listening to him.

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:13.340
As soon as Ryuu gets out of the
hospital, let’s all go somewhere.

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:13.920
Yeah.

00:16:14.520 --> 00:16:15.390
That's a good idea.

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:17.840
But where?

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:27.230
What's wrong, Kyuu?

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:29.020
Nothing...

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:34.110
Come in.

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:44.120
How are you, our prince?

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:46.250
This man...

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:47.830
Go home.

00:16:48.310 --> 00:16:50.080
I don’t want a visit from you!

00:16:51.770 --> 00:16:52.710
Talented indeed.

00:16:54.650 --> 00:16:54.960
/
4

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:58.130
You knew who I was with just one glance.

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:04.810
But, as it’s my fault you were hurt,
I should at least pay you a visit.

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:06.390
What did you say?

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:09.390
I programmed a post-hypnotic order
to have the client kill the person

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:17.490
who successfully uncovers our plan
and identifies the criminal.

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:24.280
But on condition that they were not to do so
if you were the one who had figured it out.

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:30.830
But I never thought that you would leap in front of him.

00:17:31.270 --> 00:17:32.540
I’m very sorry.

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:36.300
Beautiful, is it not? This black rose.

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:38.970
It’s a variety called “Black Pearl”.

00:17:39.610 --> 00:17:43.720
It looks so much like dried blood.

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:47.220
I’m sorry,

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:49.430
I forgot to introduce myself.

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:53.860
Within the organization I am known as “Anubis”.

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:55.360
Get out!

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:02.200
A group of cruel murderers!

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:05.370
We are not murderers.

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:15.630
We accept clients who long for revenge, eliminating
an enemy who threatens them,

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:22.010
and lend ourselves to their righteous desire, constructing
and coordinating the perfect plan.

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:24.140
We are a proud group of geniuses.

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:31.600
You are the one person who carries the bloodline
of our great founder,

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:39.190
An important person who has been
promised as our second ruler.

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:51.960
I'll never take over a group of criminals like you!

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:57.380
My my, so you've been completely
poisoned by the hypocrites at DDS.

00:18:57.400 --> 00:19:02.340
Well then as I don't want to aggravate you wounds,

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:03.010
I shall leave.

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:09.560
Do you know what the black rose symbolizes?

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:13.640
“You are mine, forever.”

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:19.400
You can’t run away from your fate.

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:35.120
The proud soul of a demon resides within
you, just as it resides within me.

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:38.130
God, please,

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:41.550
end my accursed life now!

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:46.840
Or give me the strength to fight!

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:54.140
Ryuu-kun has vanished from the hospital!

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:55.850
Ryuu’s gone?

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:59.940
We just received a call from the hospital.

00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:02.570
No way. Why would he do that?

00:20:02.840 --> 00:20:05.030
Do you think he just went home?

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:07.820
Then he wouldn’t have just vanished.

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:10.120
Something must have happened.

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:12.950
Let’s all split up and search for him!

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:15.040
Search where?

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:17.000
The whole town!

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:18.810
Ryuu.

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:23.460
Ryuu!

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:26.900
Ryuu!

00:20:27.460 --> 00:20:29.280
Where did he go?

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:37.660
Ryuu-kun.

00:20:51.260 --> 00:20:58.500
You are the one person who carries the bloodline
of our great founder,

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:04.630
An important person who has been
promised as our second ruler.

00:21:07.240 --> 00:21:09.550
“You are mine, forever.”

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:12.760
You can’t run away from fate.

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:15.180
Should I just jump?

00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:16.100
Or go somewhere far away?

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:19.850
You can’t get away, I said!

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:21.150
I can’t?

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:26.820
I can’t fight my accursed fate?

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:36.330
Ryuu!

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:42.500
Ryuu, what happened?

00:21:42.520 --> 00:21:44.380
You just vanished from the hospital.

00:21:45.030 --> 00:21:48.170
Everybody got worried, split up and searched for you.

00:21:49.690 --> 00:21:51.230
Anyways I'm glad I found you.

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:54.890
Your mother must be worried.

00:21:55.870 --> 00:22:00.390
Actually, that wasn’t my mother who came to get me.

00:22:00.750 --> 00:22:01.940
But...

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:03.770
I'll tell you why eventually.

00:22:04.780 --> 00:22:07.240
Anyway Kyuu, I have a request.

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:10.070
What is it?

00:22:11.430 --> 00:22:14.280
Can stay at your place for a while?

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:16.950
You’re running away from home?

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:20.410
No. If it’s a problem then never mind.

00:22:27.570 --> 00:22:30.800
I'm sorry I requested something so strange, Kyuu.

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:34.430
I'll be happy to have you.

00:22:35.450 --> 00:22:37.850
I don’t know why you’re saying this,

00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:40.350
but I’m on your side.

00:22:44.670 --> 00:22:45.110
Let’s go!

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:51.030
Thanks. Really.

00:22:55.680 --> 00:22:57.990
I'm terribly sorry, Sir Anubis.

00:22:58.180 --> 00:23:03.120
I got a message from Ryuu-sama,
that he would not be returning.

00:23:03.560 --> 00:23:07.500
Most likely he’s staying at the house
of one of the other Q-class members.

00:23:07.780 --> 00:23:09.130
Leave him alone.

00:23:11.740 --> 00:23:15.260
If he gets close to one the students
of that group of hypocrites, DDS,

00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:19.220
it could prove fatal to him becoming
the successor to King Hades!

00:23:19.750 --> 00:23:21.890
It’s the opposite, Miss Yuria.

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:31.900
The thoughts of the great King Hades are far beyond
what you lower ranks could ever contemplate.

00:23:32.550 --> 00:23:33.570
Don’t worry.

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:36.320
Just watch what happens.

00:23:38.890 --> 00:23:42.080
Ryuu-sama will come back.

00:23:47.860 --> 00:23:51.770
Somehow it's collapsing

00:23:51.800 --> 00:23:54.140
Embracing such a feeling.

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:55.030
Flowing.

00:23:55.050 --> 00:23:58.910
I'd be worried tomorrow.

00:23:58.930 --> 00:24:01.120
If the same thing happened.

00:24:01.140 --> 00:24:02.120
Go wrong.

00:24:02.130 --> 00:24:06.460
He looks up at the sky, pondering

00:24:06.470 --> 00:24:09.020
You're very far away.

00:24:09.930 --> 00:24:13.180
Show your heart if you have the courage

00:24:13.190 --> 00:24:16.310
passing the border line.

00:24:16.330 --> 00:24:19.760
In order to get past, I walk against the wind

00:24:19.770 --> 00:24:23.400
and I can finish a battle.

00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:26.940
When I feel like an abandoned child

00:24:26.970 --> 00:24:30.360
then I'll stand in line with you.

00:24:30.390 --> 00:24:33.930
Facing the wind, I forget,

00:24:33.940 --> 00:24:37.540
somehow this is the only important thing.

00:24:37.550 --> 00:24:40.290
We protect, because there Is no return.

00:24:40.310 --> 00:24:41.890
It's becoming dearly.

00:24:41.920 --> 00:24:45.840
Today I embrace, right now I conquer.

00:24:47.250 --> 00:24:48.820
A series of labyrinthine alleys that we wandered into;

00:24:47.380 --> 00:24:56.120
Next Episode

00:24:49.340 --> 00:24:50.940
the strange shadow that lurks in the darkness;

00:24:51.800 --> 00:24:54.910
lead by the sound of a wind-chime, a headless
woman disappears into a blind alley.

00:24:56.050 --> 00:24:58.780
There is no exit from the labyrinth born from hatred,

00:24:59.270 --> 00:25:03.460
and the fate that awaits those who
see the ,headless woman twice...

00:25:04.060 --> 00:25:05.000
There’s only one answer!

00:25:07.610 --> 00:25:10.840
There’s only one bed, you don’t
mind sharing it, do you

00:25:10.990 --> 00:25:14.800
Huh, well if you're OK then I am.

00:25:15.160 --> 00:25:16.840
OK! Then let’s sleep!

00:25:17.910 --> 00:25:18.610
Yeah.

00:25:18.550 --> 00:25:21.780
Just kidding. I'll put out a futon for you!
